Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, fighting for\Ntomorrow. Go catch what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, run\Nlike a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, believe\Nyou can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean? Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away the crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there are no rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit me, I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you only wait out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We can let go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, grow with a rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight if you don't want to\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can't achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight for your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That I want, but you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, and you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that you can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, knock-knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can Sabo please come out to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You were zoning out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes have been glossed\Nover this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, remember you have a position now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go picking fights with Navy\Nadmirals over personal grudges, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to lead our\Narmy into an Alto war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But my brother comes first, always.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:02:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reckless behavior is going\Nto cause problems for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Boo-hoo! Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned through new info.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When all is said and done, the Navy and\NDoflamingo are both unnecessary here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're birds of a feather, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy and I can never play\Nthe hero for this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simply not our place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What if someone catches\Non to your rationale?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All they'll see is that I\Nhit a snag getting past you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Said like a true gambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Luck's on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kay, understood, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Zappo, the nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting really tired of\Nbeing chewed out on your behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll lure the other criminals out\Nwith the ones we already caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be foolproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I really am! Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we are free!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you guys came here to catch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.91,0:04:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We were wrong from the get-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We've had a decade-long\Ngrudge against King Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but how could we do this to him\Nwhen he's a victim of Doflamingo II?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we\Npraised that evil pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And even after we learned the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,about what he did to our loved ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and how he enslaved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We were still seeking salvation\Nfrom that deceitful bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know what\Nwe're supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A change of heart, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They have taken me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, please tell\Nus what we should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you propose we fight,\Nwe shall take aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We await your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please, King.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.10,0:05:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In that event, I say we stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's necessary, we can brace\Nourselves for death later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Without realizing it, it seems that I've\Ncome to believe in Luffy's victory as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Historically, Dressrosa has\Nstood as a symbol of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned if I see this\Nkingdom fall into war again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't catch a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like we're both about to\Ngo all in on this high-stakes game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One for Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that was quite a blow. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you it wouldn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we've wasted our only\Nchance to use that trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop sending fakes! Fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we know all about how\Nyour ability operates, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have forgotten\Nthat we had our eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,on the app-op room for\Nquite some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can chop me up into a million pieces,\Nbut I'm gonna turn back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm ready for round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally noticed the radio knife doesn't\Nwork the same as my regular amputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For the next few minutes, you'll\Nbe unable to use your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well relax,\Nyou're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.64,0:07:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouble's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose is running!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.84,0:07:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At least get me a tissue!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your crystal trainer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare come near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Injection!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap-like answer! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shots!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And the finisher!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fulbright!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Trophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recall what I hate more than\Nanything else in the world, Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's being looked down on! Remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to dodge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing what I'm capable of,\Ndid you really believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.85,0:09:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that you wretched little\Nbrats thought I was so weak
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,that I would fall to you in your\Npathetic surprise attack—well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I find that to be the highest\Nform of disrespect imaginable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I descend from the noblest\Nof bloodlines in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The celestial
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,dragons—just the fact that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I exist makes me deserving of admiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I possessed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the rarest of powers\Nknown to man; however,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,my worthless father abandoned\Nthe greatest birthright in the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,world—our priceless divine\Nnobility—then our fate was sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,our fate was sealed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole family was sentenced to suffer\Namong the commoners in this rotten cesspool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Live like a human, he would squawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My father was nothing but an imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiya, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did all the slaves go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's buy some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Daddy, why are they\Nnot kneeling before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is coming after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a family of Celestial\NDragons! Don't kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make them suffer instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I experienced both heaven\Nand hell firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I took it upon myself\Nto end my suffering by
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing the head of my own\Nfather back to Marie Joie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,can you believe that the\NCelestial Dragons would tell
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,a ten-year-old boy they\Nwouldn't take back someone from
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:11:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A line of traitors. It was\Nthen that I found there was no
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,escaping this hell from that\Nmoment forward i swore that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,i would destroy everything\Nthey held dear to put it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,frankly every damn thing in\Nthe world the lives you've led
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,cannot possibly be compared\Nto what i've been through i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,not wasting my time screwing\Naround with brats like you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's below me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't want to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, I can't fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With this much loot, we can\Nrebuild our ship, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, does she, does she? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:12:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to deal\Nwith your pillaging right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna kill itself at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.89,0:12:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have some ammo, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you expecting of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're short on both tranquilizers and men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got our hands tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Maynard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, status report.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's concerning Sabo and Admiral Isho.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The fight between them ended in a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't joke around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.18,0:12:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our admirals from the\NNavy headquarters are
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,some of the best combatants\Nwe have to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not Isho?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:13:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the world government\Nhas no business playing god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's not adding up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll settle it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now we have to get\Nthis chaos under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can round up all pirates\Nwho went after the flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the kingdom is safe,\Ndo I make myself clear, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not harm any civilians or animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your orders are to sedate\Nanyone who is not in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kids okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.31,0:13:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Octopus Stare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost had me! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even comprehend\Nthe situation, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me put it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If people could harm a celestial dragon,\Njust imagine the things they'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Humanity is cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking\Nabout, you fake mingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.52,0:14:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time we start\Nrolling out those executions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're first on my list, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing still doesn't make sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As a former Celestial Dragon,\Nbanished from Arishua,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,how do you still wield their power?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,CP0 is working directly\Nunder the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But you called them here this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your last request.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want to know the dirty details?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because I know all about a very\Nimportant national treasure—something
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that's hidden within the holy land of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie Joie—it gives you\Nthat much leverage, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.02,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You could even say its very\Nexistence could shake humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him kill doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That child must not be allowed\Nto see another day! To them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a ticking time bomb—an escapee\Nwith dirt that could destroy their world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But those cowards became quite cooperative\Nonce they realized they couldn't kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,though they did try—if only\NI'd had the op—op fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,in my possession at that\Ncrucial point in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Things would have played\Nout a bit differently;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have been able to\Nutilize Marie Joie's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,able to utilize marie joie's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,national treasure and seize\Nthe world by the net that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That should show you just how valuable
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,your fruit actually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from personality transplant\Nsurgery, there's another use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,even aware of that fact law?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In the right hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the op-op fruit has the power to make\Nmankind's oldest most sought-after dream a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,reality that's why\Nyou'll hear many refer to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it as the ultimate devil\Nfruit yeah i know i've
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,no interest in using\Nit for that though the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,great mystery of the fruit is its ability
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,known as the perpetual\Nyouth surgery right it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,grants eternal life and\Nyet By performing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the surgeon sacrifices\Ntheir own in exchange
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I had no\Nintention of letting you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,eat it But you repaid my\Nkindness with betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then allow me to apologize for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamante's sword play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Bullet String.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And Lao G's martial arts. Rune!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.22,0:17:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An injection shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and that one's from Gladius.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You learned all your fighting skills from\Nus, yet you bite the hand that feeds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason I'm alive\Nnow is thanks to Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm grateful to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me the power I need\Nto kick your ass after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop laughing! I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't kill a person\Nwith your spirit alone, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you guys, I have explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't mess with pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't catch me! Where's the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Duffy's a very busy fellow and\Ndoesn't have time for a brat like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you kind of just had a weight to\Nus since you're gonna die soon anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But, when though?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How long, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When you get a crow, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In three years and two months from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I read it on my medical charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My dead father was a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What a smart little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.20,0:19:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to use my last\Nthree years killing as
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,many people as I can and\Ndestroying everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, get a lot of Mr. Big Talk here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got sniffles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not all hope is lost\Nsince we accept children.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say we've had about 100\Nor so come through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But most of the little rugrats run\Naway crying within a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you have what\Nit takes, little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guess what, Diamante?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, guess what, Treville?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,See them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Buffalo and Baby Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The only ones remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Cora's on his way here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He tripped! Yay! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.64,0:20:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bell on your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bell on your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.66,0:20:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okoda, I brought you a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Corazon, did you finish the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hand over my cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:21:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to make sure there's transparency\Nwhen it comes to dealing with money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Law, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy who just came back\Nis an executive like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Couran.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He may come across as\Na thick-headed klutz,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but truth is, he comes\Nfrom a powerful bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say he's\NDofie's little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As a side note, he doesn't talk\Nanymore because of some old trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.02,0:21:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He hates kids, so watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.62,0:21:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.74,0:21:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He threw that kid right\Nout with the trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.94,0:21:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M GONNA KILL HIM!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,GONNA CALL FIRE AGAIN!
